// product/compute_fabric.dag — Elastic compute fabric (Worksheet A / exploration §4.0f cases 1–8).
//
// LAYER: product, not std. This is a DOMAIN MODEL (a compute supply/demand/placement
// market), not a standard-library primitive. It imports std/ only and is consumed by
// applications/tests; the operator's CONCRETE fleet instances live further out still
// (ctrl plans.fabric.operator_fleet), and vendor catalogs in extdeps.{cpu,cloud}.
//
// Authority: this module (.dag self-authoritative; worksheet refs retired).
// Composition: cache via ExecutionReceipt.output only — MUST NOT import cache_interface.
//
// Ingress types (UpsertInputRef, ChangeSet, ArtifactRef) are v2.workflow.ci / v2.std.change
// authority — forward-stubbed as Node until harness wires cross-module checks (P-CF-INGRESS).

